  "question": {
    "text": "One-fourth length of a uniform rod is placed on a rough horizontal surface and it starts rotating about the edge as soon as we release it. The rod starts slipping on the edge when it has turned through an angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math>.&nbsp;If the coefficient of friction between rod and surface is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi></math>, and it satisfies the relation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>μ</mi></math>, then what is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>? [Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image4-9b612ea3-7e0a-447e-b82d-5c9f863eb7a4.jpg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "13",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>         <br/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image5-6c2a0b2f-e957-4eb7-999b-68d5c73ef755.jpg\" /> <br/><br/>         <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> <br/><br/>        Solving,<br/><br/>         <math><mn>13</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow></mrow></math> .",
